cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "tjax: Tools for JAX"
abstract: >-
  tjax provides tools for the differential programming library JAX: dataclasses that are JAX
  pytrees; the optax gradient transformations as pytrees, so that JAX can trace, differentiate,
  and map over their hyperparameters; and pretty printing of nested values, including traced values
  inside jitted functions.
